  pool 4, flat 8, up22 2, flat 10, gap 3, flat 9, down22 2, flat 6
  spikes 4, flat 10, up 3, flat 8, down 3
  pool 6, flat 10, up22 3, flat 14, down 3, flat 12
  spikes 3, flat 8, up 2, flat 22

